  "body": "[`long long`](https://heycam.github.io/webidl/#es-long-long) and [`unsigned long long`](https://heycam.github.io/webidl/#es-unsigned-long-long) behave differently when used in conjunction with [Clamp] or [EnforceRange]. In that case the max supported value is 2^53 – 1. When used without extended attributes, it's 2^64.\r\n\r\nParticularly relevant are steps 2.3, 3.1 and 6 of both algorithms.\r\n",
